  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IISD- Transparency, Accountability and Inclusion for Climate Action at National &amp; Global Levels</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NAP Global Network supports countries&#x2019; national climate adaptation processes through the provision of technical assistance, knowledge resources, and peer-to-peer learning. Ireland&#x2019;s support is dedicated to LDCs and SIDS and focuses on improving MEL systems in order to develop effective progress tracking of adaptation. This will enhance countries&#x2019; ability to engage with and inform international climate developments including the UNFCCC Global Stocktake and negotiation of a Global Goal on Adaptation.</narrative>
  </description>
